{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1109866-2e-moon-phase-of-auspice-mechanical-influance","id":1109866,"title":"[2E] Moon Phase of Auspice mechanical influance","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-06-30T12:35:40-07:00","id":1109866,"title":"[2E] Moon Phase of Auspice mechanical influance","content":"Try to understand whole influance of Moon Phase of your Auspice on your Uratha character. Someone complied it? As rules are scattered over 2E rulebook.<br /> <br /> <b>Edit:</b> <b>List of benefits of Auspice Moon on the sky for Forsaken</b> (from answers) :<ul><li>The first time an Uratha sees her auspice moon at night, she gains a point of Essence.</li> <li>+2 bonus to activate Gifts Facets</li> <li>Moon Kissed Merit gives you +4 from Willpower dice for the associated Auspice Skill and 9-Again on Skill.</li> <li>Potential Modifier for Auspice Gift or Rite.</li> <li>Lets the Moon-Marked Tell Boon work.</li> </ul><b>Drawback of Auspice Moon:</b><ul><li>Potential Death Rage Trigger</li> </ul>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 05-19-2018, 11:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T12:48:48-07:00","id":1109873,"title":"","content":"The first time an Uratha sees her auspice moon at night, she gains a point of Essence.<br /> <br /> Moon Kissed Merit gives you +4 from Willpower dice for the associated Auspice Skill.<br /> <br /> Potential Modifier for Auspice Gift or Rite.<br /> Potential Trigger.<br /> <br /> Lets the Moon-Marked Tell Boon work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T13:01:13-07:00","id":1109882,"title":"","content":"Free dot in one of three Auspice Skills (see also the Moon-Kissed Merit), free dot in Auspice Renown, default Renown for Clash of Wills, Hunter's Aspect, Auspice benefit as per auspice writeup, available Moon Gifts, at least two Shadow Gift affinities, +2 to Facet rolls during your auspice moon phase, +1 bonus to rolls for rites you're the ritemaster for while your auspice moon is in the sky, regain a point of Essence the first time you see your auspice moon in a night.<br /> <br /> Most of that is in the character creation section like you'd expect.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T13:36:46-07:00","id":1109910,"title":"","content":"I meant things like there is Full Moon that night - and how this influenca mechanics for the Rahu across country.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-06-30T13:39:48-07:00","id":1109911,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1109866-2e-moon-phase-of-auspice-mechanical-influance?p=1109910#post1109910\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I meant things like there is Full Moon that night - and how this influenca mechanics for the Rahu across country.</div> </div> </div> </div>I answered that in my post. There's some 'feeling' things but you specifically asked for mechanics. Fortunately there's not many.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T13:10:46-07:00","id":1110637,"title":"","content":"IIRC, you added your Auspice Renown to your duration in gauru in 1e, but that seems to have been dropped.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>LFP: Foreign Bodies (Deviant: the Renegades)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/969-verge","name":"Verge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T13:24:53-07:00","id":1110640,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Verge</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1109866-2e-moon-phase-of-auspice-mechanical-influance?p=1110637#post1110637\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">IIRC, you added your Auspice Renown to your duration in gauru in 1e, but that seems to have been dropped.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's a Rage Gift now, Honor Facet. Not limited to during your Auspice Moon phase.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 07-02-2017, 04:29 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T13:45:35-07:00","id":1110649,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1109866-2e-moon-phase-of-auspice-mechanical-influance?p=1110640#post1110640\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's a Rage Gift now, Honor Facet. Not limited to during your Auspice Moon phase.</div> </div> </div> </div>Which makes it a Blood Talon affinity. However, if a ST so desired, he could reintroduce the duration bonus to all Auspices without having to rework Perfected Rage.<br /> <br /> I think originally that rule was intended to invoke the full moon mythos, but the Sacred Hunt does that now, and without disadvantaging the Pure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>LFP: Foreign Bodies (Deviant: the Renegades)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/969-verge","name":"Verge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-02T20:44:37-07:00","id":1110743,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1109866-2e-moon-phase-of-auspice-mechanical-influance?p=1109873#post1109873\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Moon Kissed Merit gives you +4 from Willpower dice for the associated Auspice Skill.</div> </div> </div> </div>And 9 again in that skill, or 8 again if you already have 9 again.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T00:15:12-07:00","id":1110774,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Verge</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1109866-2e-moon-phase-of-auspice-mechanical-influance?p=1110649#post1110649\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think originally that rule was intended to invoke the full moon mythos, but the Sacred Hunt does that now, and without disadvantaging the Pure.</div> </div> </div> </div>How Sacred Hunt is invoking full moon mythos? Siskur-Dah is totally <i>conscious decision</i> to hunt Prey - as it is Ritual to perform - were popculture mythos is all about <i>instincts forced</i> hunting on humans under Full Moon.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-07-03T22:08:11-07:00","id":1111163,"title":"","content":"It's the notion of werewolves hunting on a regular cycle, rather than total loss of control. That is, it's a thematic shout-out to the traditional full moon werewolf attack, rather than a literal implementation of it. A mature pack of Uratha is hunting on a schedule measured in months, up until one hits Primal-Urge 5, anyway.<br /> <br /> And to say it's a conscious decision, that's not entirely true. Once the hunt is due, refusing to hunt becomes a dangerous choice. Werewolves who have struck a balanced Harmony are at risk of spiralling toward the Flesh extreme, making them easier to trigger. Low-Harmony wolves still have to deal with Essence loss, which can make it difficult to keep from blasting into gauru at the first sign of a fight. That this becomes a problem once every 4 weeks is where my argument lies.<br /> <br /> Give or take: I'm pretty shitty on schedules myself...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>LFP: Foreign Bodies (Deviant: the Renegades)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/969-verge","name":"Verge","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"378"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-10T20:42:40-08:00","id":1166593,"title":"","content":"Continuing main topic - I try to use constant penalties for senses related actions at night for <i><b>everyone</b></i>, based on Moon Phase. It works like this:<ul><li>On New Moon is -2 penalty</li> <li>At Full Moon it's no penalty ( as it's 'almost bright as in day' )</li> <li>At any other Moon Phase it's -1 penalty</li> </ul>Simple and elegant. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> It's also nicely highlight that 'Irraka are secretive and always up to something' and 'Rahu wants simple and straight forward answers, like in day'. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> And I want to point that Uratha have all bonus to senses related actions in any form, even in human Hishu they have +1 bonus. So werewolves still have slight edge in night over any other enemy. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 12-10-2017, 11:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T04:41:29-08:00","id":1166948,"title":"","content":"Uratha senses are generally beyond mere darkness to penalize.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T05:14:21-08:00","id":1166957,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1109866-2e-moon-phase-of-auspice-mechanical-influance?p=1166948#post1166948\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Uratha senses are generally beyond mere darkness to penalize.</div> </div> </div> </div>Got any quote from 2E corebook on that?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-12-12T08:12:02-08:00","id":1167003,"title":"","content":"'Further, if she would normally suffer penalties due to deprivation (blindness, strong scents, or deafness), her other senses compensate, negating those penalties entirely.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-19T08:24:57-07:00","id":1220252,"title":"","content":"I founded that Auspice Moon on the sky gives you bonus to activating Gifts Facet:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>WtF 2E corebook, p. 115</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">+2 Using a Facet during her auspice moon phase</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-05-19T18:18:31-07:00","id":1220383,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1109866-2e-moon-phase-of-auspice-mechanical-influance?p=1220252#post1220252\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I founded that Auspice Moon on the sky gives you bonus to activating Gifts Facet:</div> </div> </div> </div>I told you this a year ago:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1109866-2e-moon-phase-of-auspice-mechanical-influance?p=1109882#post1109882\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Free dot in one of three Auspice Skills (see also the Moon-Kissed Merit), free dot in Auspice Renown, default Renown for Clash of Wills, Hunter's Aspect, Auspice benefit as per auspice writeup, available Moon Gifts, at least two Shadow Gift affinities, <b>+2 to Facet rolls during your auspice moon phase</b>, +1 bonus to rolls for rites you're the ritemaster for while your auspice moon is in the sky, regain a point of Essence the first time you see your auspice moon in a night.<br /> <br /> Most of that is in the character creation section like you'd expect.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}